			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "A9p4_REfijxfoXT79",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "AOMJm9kvi-EZsASUg",
			"text": "Blurred Breeze: When the air mephit flies at Move 6 or faster, its form becomes blurred. Attempts to spot the mephit with normal vision and Infravision are at -4, as are attacks that rely on these senses. In addition, the mephit gains a +1 bonus to Dodge. This is a magical ability."
		},
